{"title": "Harp-Shaped Pin", "pageid": 28206, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Harp-Shaped_Pin", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png/300px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/f0/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Harp-Shaped Pin image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png/300px-Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Harp-Shaped_Pin_Faded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Harp-Shaped Pin</b> is a common miscellaneous item. It's a pin worn by <a href=\"/wiki/Harpers\" title=\"Harpers\">Harpers</a> and can be used to unlock the passage to Jaheira's basement in <a href=\"/wiki/Elerrathin%27s_Home\" title=\"Elerrathin's Home\">Elerrathin's Home</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A small but detailed pin, depicting a harp offset against a crescent moon.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Act One:\n<ul><li>On the corpse of an executed <a href=\"/wiki/Jhaam\" title=\"Jhaam\">Drow</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Act Two:\n<ul><li>In a pile of viscera in the <a href=\"/wiki/Oubliette\" title=\"Oubliette\">Oubliette</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;623&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-99</span></li></ul></li>\n<li>Act Three:\n<ul><li>Obtained by talking to <a href=\"/wiki/Tate\" title=\"Tate\">Tate</a>, upstairs in the <a href=\"/wiki/Elerrathin%27s_Home\" title=\"Elerrathin's Home\">Elerrathin's Home</a>, or in the upstairs wardrobe if Jaheira died in Act Two</li>\n<li>In a mahogany casket in the <a href=\"/wiki/Graveyard_(Lower_City)#Mortuary\" title=\"Graveyard (Lower City)\">Lower City Graveyard mortuary</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;40&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;29</span></li>\n<li>In the old pouch at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-217&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-53</span> on top of the roof of <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira's</a> home</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194932\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 948/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9955/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3454/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 691598/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.292      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   30.292      1 -total\n 25.06%    7.590      4 Template:Icon_text\n 22.99%    6.964      1 Template:PageSeo\n 22.96%    6.954      1 Template:Main_only\n 22.13%    6.704      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 18.31%    5.546      8 Template:Trim\n 13.56%    4.107      1 Template:Icon_link\n 10.15%    3.076      4 Template:Ifempty\n  9.15%    2.771      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28206-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714194932 and revision id 257636. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}